{"unit_id":"2486809961-alt__dsh-ui-sound-ns2#feature-1","repo":"2486809961-alt/dsh-ui-sound-ns2","commit":"fae204795b9c3a8ffc6272580bb24299e69195de","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"NS2 界面音效的「场景化点击提示」：点击控件时按按钮、开关、标签、链接、滑块等类别播放对应提示音，其他位置也可播放普通点击音。通过鼠标或键盘激活控件触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:402-457","lib/client.js:750-789"]}
{"unit_id":"2486809961-alt__dsh-ui-sound-ns2#feature-2","repo":"2486809961-alt/dsh-ui-sound-ns2","commit":"fae204795b9c3a8ffc6272580bb24299e69195de","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"NS2 界面音效的「任务状态提示」：监听当前会话的运行状态，在任务启动、成功完成或失败时播放对应声音；检测到待处理交互时也会提醒。状态变化后自动触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:931-969"]}
{"unit_id":"2486809961-alt__dsh-ui-sound-ns2#feature-3","repo":"2486809961-alt/dsh-ui-sound-ns2","commit":"fae204795b9c3a8ffc6272580bb24299e69195de","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"NS2 界面音效的「音效偏好设置」：设置页可调整总音量、点击音和任务音等开关，并为各交互场景选择提示音；在页面预听音效，偏好由宿主接口保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:240-308","lib/client.js:615-705","lib/index.js:368-397"]}
{"unit_id":"2486809961-alt__dsh-ui-sound-ns2#feature-4","repo":"2486809961-alt/dsh-ui-sound-ns2","commit":"fae204795b9c3a8ffc6272580bb24299e69195de","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"NS2 界面音效的「快捷静音」：按 Command 或 Ctrl+Shift+M，或点击会话输入框下方的静音按钮，即可关闭或恢复整层提示音，并播放切换确认音。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:808-821","lib/client.js:344-380","lib/client.js:1017-1023"]}
